---
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-line-soft bg-charcoal/60">
  <div class="shell py-14 md:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <a href="/" class="font-display text-2xl tracking-[0.3em] text-paper">CINESCOPE</a>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-[0.85rem] leading-loose text-muted">
          {SITE.description}
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 font-display text-[0.8rem] italic tracking-[0.06em] text-gold/80">
          Discover Cinema Beyond the Mainstream.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <h2 class="kicker mb-5">栏目</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {
            SITE.nav.map((item) => (
              <li>
                <a href={item.href} class="text-[0.85rem] text-paper-dim transition-colors hover:text-gold">
                  {item.label}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <h2 class="kicker mb-5">编辑说明</h2>
        <p class="text-[0.8rem] leading-loose text-muted">
          CineScope 的全部公开内容由 AI 编辑部策划、撰写与校对，依据 TMDb、IMDb 官方数据集、
          Wikidata、电影节官网与公开专业影评等可核实资料。文章中的事实、外部观点与编辑判断分别标注。
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[0.8rem] leading-loose text-muted">
          电影海报与剧照版权归各发行方所有，本站仅作评介用途并注明来源。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-line-soft pt-6 text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.08em] text-muted/70 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {year} CineScope · 一本持续出版的电影杂志</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-5">
        <a href="/about/" class="transition-colors hover:text-paper">关于我们</a>
        <a href="/about/#privacy" class="transition-colors hover:text-paper">隐私政策</a>
        <a href="/rss.xml" class="transition-colors hover:text-paper">RSS</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
